0 en /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages; 124 paquetes instalados; grep por torch/torchopt/functorch/jax/numpy/scipy en pip list y en /usr/lib/python3/dist-packages no devuelve coincidencias reales. `import torch`, `import torchopt`, `import functorch`, `import numpy`, `import scipy` \\u2192 todos ModuleNotFoundError. `curl --max-time 3 https://pypi.org/simple/` \\u2192 \\\"Could not resolve host: pypi.org\\\" (red deshabilitada, confirmado). `nvidia-smi` falla por driver no cargado; `gpu_enabled=false` en brief. `nproc`=24; ~706 GB libres en /workspace; 63 GB tmpfs en /tmp.\"}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-4863f030-73a7-4efc-9520-04ebacefade7", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "kind": "ActionEvent", "source_event_index": 22}
